// =============================================================================
// Elements: the element as an entity of its own.
// -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Every element symbol the surfaces table may use, with what a filter wants to
// group by: atomic number, group, period, block and a category (alkali metal,
// alkaline earth metal, transition metal, post-transition metal, metalloid,
// nonmetal, halogen, lanthanide, actinide). surfaces.jsonc validates its
// `element` and `elements` against the keys here, and the band chart's
// Surfaces selector groups its rows by `category`.
//
// Lanthanides and actinides carry `group: null`: which of them sits in group 3
// is a convention this table does not take a side on. Properties that need a
// cited source (electronegativity, oxophilicity) are not carried yet; add them
// with the scale they come from, not as bare numbers.
// =============================================================================
